+- Directory sweep (owner instruction): one YouTube query "<company name> YC application video" (top 8 results) per YC company in batches S2015-F2024 (4,202 companies in the directory mirror; W2015 was not included). Completed for 402 companies (~10%) before YouTube rate-limiting (HTTP 403 / bot checks) blocked further queries; companies after the first ~360 were processed in random order, so the swept subset after that point is a random sample. Hits required the company (or former) name and an application/founder-video keyword in the title, then a manual identity check (batch and founder names).
+- No Vimeo/X/LinkedIn per-company sweep was possible (no usable search endpoint); founder-name queries were not run because the directory mirror lacks founder names and per-company page fetches for all companies were out of budget.
